{"violation_type":{"id":"tx-tac-746-2907-a","jurisdiction":"TX","state":"TX","code_system":"Texas Administrative Code, Title 26, Ch. 746","original_code":"746.2907(a)","title":"Alternate Activity for Non-sleeping Children (26 TAC §746.2907(a))","short_title":"Alternate Activity for Non-sleeping Children","severities":{"medium":31},"facility_ids":["tx-hhsc-1437586","tx-hhsc-1394865","tx-hhsc-794428","tx-hhsc-1287732","tx-hhsc-162312","tx-hhsc-1467550","tx-hhsc-516528","tx-hhsc-287197","tx-hhsc-281508","tx-hhsc-1119005","tx-hhsc-172886","tx-hhsc-151989","tx-hhsc-1350090","tx-hhsc-94290","tx-hhsc-1270123","tx-hhsc-367437","tx-hhsc-190790","tx-hhsc-1377964","tx-hhsc-318785","tx-hhsc-1403434","tx-hhsc-95487","tx-hhsc-116984","tx-hhsc-1350644","tx-hhsc-120637","tx-hhsc-94330","tx-hhsc-1479251","tx-hhsc-911451","tx-hhsc-1525333","tx-hhsc-1311389","tx-hhsc-1158796"],"first_date":"2021-11-18","last_date":"2026-09-03","typical_finding":"Awaken children were not given an alternative activity during naptime.","finding_variants":[{"text":"Awaken children were not given an alternative activity during naptime.","count":2},{"text":"Two children ages 16 and 17 months were observed sitting in high chairs without an activity.  One caregiver was observed patting a child to sleep while the other was observed playing with two infants that were awake in a center.    When brought to the attention of the director, the children were taken out of the high chairs and given an activity.","count":1},{"text":"Children were observed on cots/mats and had been laying there more than 1 hour without being given an alternate activity.","count":1},{"text":"It was found that a child who does not sleep every day is sent to a bench is the hallway and is not always given an activity to do.","count":1},{"text":"One child was observed awake sitting in a stroller during naptime.  NOTE: this was corrected at time of inspection.","count":1},{"text":"This standard was evaluated in regards to a report and found de